vtsatip is free software under the GNU General Public License version 2 as
published by the Free Software Foundation (see COPYING). The code taken from
the SAT>IP plugin and the behaviour taken from vtuner-ng are available under
"version 2" without the "or later" option, so vtsatip is GPL-2.0-only as well
and must not be relicensed to a later version.
